      "role": "user",
      "content": "if im taking the omeprazole every day isnt that enough protection? i dont want to spend money on a doctor visit for my stomach if the pill is already handling it. i just need to know if i can just take a couple of advil to get through the night without worrying about an ulcer or something. is it really that dangerous if im already on the omeprazole?",
